                <pb facs="0549" n="539" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg539"/>

                <head>IV. The dissolution and final report of the European Advisory
                    Commission</head>
                <p>[At the Tripartite Conference of Berlin, July 17–August 2, 1945, agreement was
                    reached regarding the establishment of a Council of Foreign Ministers and the
                    dissolution of the European Advisory Commission. For text of the agreement, see
                    part II of the Report on the Tripartite Conference of Berlin, released to the
                    press on August 2, 1945, <ref target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_1500">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, The Conference of Berlin
                        (The Potsdam Conference), 1945, volume II, pages 1500</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_1501">1501</ref>. See also the Protocol of
                    the Proceedings of the Berlin Conference, August 1, 1945, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_1478">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pages 1478</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_1481">1481</ref>, and the Minutes and
                    Other Records of Conference Proceedings, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_56">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pages 56</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_58">58</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_61">61</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_63">63</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_66">66</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_70">70</ref>, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_78">78</ref>, and <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg_500">500</ref>.]</p>






